"To determine how many calories Kendra would burn if she shoots hoops for 30 minutes every day for one week, we need to follow these steps:\n\n1. Calculate the calories burned per minute.\n2. Calculate the calories burned per day.\n3. Calculate the calories burned in one week.\n\nFirst, we know that shooting hoops for 30 minutes burns 150 calories. Therefore, the calories burned per minute is:\n\\[\n\\frac{150 \\text{ calories}}{30 \\text{ minutes}} = 5 \\text{ calories per minute}\n\\]\n\nNext, since Kendra shoots hoops for 30 minutes every day, the calories burned per day is:\n\\[\n5 \\text{ calories per minute} \\times 30 \\text{ minutes} = 150 \\text{ calories per day}\n\\]\n\nFinally, the calories burned in one week is:\n\\[\n150 \\text{ calories per day} \\times 7 \\text{ days} = 1050 \\text{ calories}\n\\]\n\nThus, the total calories Kendra would burn in one week is \\boxed{1050}."
