"First, we compute $\\dbinom{10}{2}$:\n\n\\[\n\\dbinom{10}{2} = \\frac{10!}{2!(10-2)!} = \\frac{10!}{2! \\cdot 8!} = \\frac{10 \\times 9}{2 \\times 1} = 45\n\\]\n\nNext, we compute $\\dbinom{8}{3}$:\n\n\\[\n\\dbinom{8}{3} = \\frac{8!}{3!(8-3)!} = \\frac{8!}{3! \\cdot 5!} = \\frac{8 \\times 7 \\times 6}{3 \\times 2 \\times 1} = 56\n\\]\n\nNow, we multiply these two results together:\n\n\\[\n\\dbinom{10}{2} \\times \\dbinom{8}{3} = 45 \\times 56 = 2520\n\\]\n\nTherefore, the final answer is $\\boxed{2520}$.\n\nFinal Answer: The final answer is $2520$."
